  "Question": "If February is a month that contains Friday the \\(13\\)th, what day of the week is February \\(1?\\)",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Sunday",
    "B": "Monday",
    "C": "Wednesday",
    "D": "Thursday",
    "E": "Saturday"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Solution": "Weekdays repeat every seven days, so February \\(13-7=6\\) was also a Friday. February \\(1\\) is five days before February \\(6\\). Counting backward from Friday gives Thursday, Wednesday, Tuesday, Monday, Sunday. Therefore February \\(1\\) was \\(\\boxed{\\text{Sunday}}\\), choice \\(\\text{A}\\).",
